sequenceDiagram
    participant Sensors as Physical Sensors<br>(MPU6050, DHT11)
    participant MQTT as Unified Namespace<br>(MQTT Broker)
    participant Frontend as 3D Visualization<br>Interface
    participant User as User Interaction
    
    Note over Sensors,User: Real-Time Synchronization Mechanism
    
    Sensors->>MQTT: 1. Publish sensor data<br>(lme/temperature, lme/vibration)
    MQTT->>Frontend: 2. Dispatch data to<br>subscribed components
    Frontend->>Frontend: 3. Update UI elements<br>and 3D model components
    User->>Frontend: 4a. User actions<br>(clicking 3D objects)
    Frontend->>MQTT: 4b. Publish user feedback<br>or control signals
    MQTT->>Sensors: 4c. Optional: Send control<br>commands to sensors
    
    Note over Sensors,User: This real-time data loop ensures the virtual environment<br>remains an up-to-date mirror of the physical system